000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. RECURSE.
000030 DATA DIVISION.
000040 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000050 01  N   PIC 99 VALUE 5.
000060 01  R   PIC 9(6).
000070 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000080     CALL "FACT" USING N R
000090     DISPLAY "5! = " R
000100     STOP RUN.
000110 END PROGRAM RECURSE.
000120 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000130 PROGRAM-ID. FACT IS RECURSIVE.
000140 DATA DIVISION.
000150 LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
000160 01  M   PIC 99.
000170 01  S   PIC 9(6).
000180 LINKAGE SECTION.
000190 01  K   PIC 99.
000200 01  RES PIC 9(6).
000210 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING K RES.
000220     IF K <= 1
000230       MOVE 1 TO RES
000240     ELSE
000250       COMPUTE M = K - 1
000260       CALL "FACT" USING M S
000270       COMPUTE RES = K * S
000280     END-IF
000290     GOBACK.
000300 END PROGRAM FACT.
